[{"id":"arafa-16-83-0","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znaju","en":"they know"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"znaju ih","en":"they know them"},{"bs":"prepoznaješ","en":"you recognize"}],"ref":"16:83","answerWord":"يَعْرِفُونَ","answerSound":"audio/2b69530cfe63a95ed9ba.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They know the favour of Allah and then deny it. Most of them are ingrates.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["يَعْرِفُونَ","نِعْمَتَ","ٱللَّهِ","ثُمَّ","يُنكِرُونَهَا","وَأَكْثَرُهُمُ","ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-2-89-19","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znali su","en":"they knew"},{"bs":"znaju ih","en":"they know them"},{"bs":"znaju ga","en":"they know him"},{"bs":"prepoznaješ","en":"you recognize"}],"ref":"2:89","answerWord":"عَرَفُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/8c2c515fbb42b36ef399.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when there cometh unto them a scripture from Allah, confirming that in their possession - though before that they were asking for a signal triumph over those who disbelieved - and when there cometh unto them that which they know (to be the truth) they disbelieve therein. The curse of Allah is on disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُمْ","كِتَٰبٌ","مِّنْ","عِندِ","ٱللَّهِ","مُصَدِّقٌ","لِّمَا","مَعَهُمْ","وَكَانُوا۟","مِن","قَبْلُ","يَسْتَفْتِحُونَ","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","فَلَمَّا","جَآءَهُم","مَّا","عَرَفُوا۟","كَفَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","فَلَعْنَةُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-2-146-3","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znaju ga","en":"they know him"},{"bs":"znali su","en":"they knew"},{"bs":"i prepoznao ih je","en":"and he recognized them"},{"bs":"biva poznat","en":"he/it is known"}],"ref":"2:146","answerWord":"يَعْرِفُونَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/fe8af917252e7025a08f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom We gave the Scripture recognise (this revelation) as they recognise their sons. But lo! a party of them knowingly conceal the truth.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَعْرِفُونَهُۥ","كَمَا","يَعْرِفُونَ","أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","وَإِنَّ","فَرِيقًا","مِّنْهُمْ","لَيَكْتُمُونَ","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَهُمْ","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-7-48-4","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znaju ih","en":"they know them"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"i prepoznao ih je","en":"and he recognized them"},{"bs":"znaju je","en":"they know it"}],"ref":"7:48","answerWord":"يَعْرِفُونَهُم","answerSound":"audio/34937d8df8671ebd4cd4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the dwellers on the Heights call unto men whom they know by their marks, (saying): What did your multitude and that in which ye took your pride avail you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["وَنَادَىٰٓ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلْأَعْرَافِ","رِجَالًا","يَعْرِفُونَهُم","بِسِيمَىٰهُمْ","قَالُوا۟","مَآ","أَغْنَىٰ","عَنكُمْ","جَمْعُكُمْ","وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-12-58-5","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i prepoznao ih je","en":"and he recognized them"},{"bs":"znaju","en":"they know"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"pa ih znate","en":"so you (all) know them"}],"ref":"12:58","answerWord":"فَعَرَفَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/46c72a518ad9cf181450.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Joseph's brethren came and presented themselves before him, and he knew them but they knew him not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["وَجَآءَ","إِخْوَةُ","يُوسُفَ","فَدَخَلُوا۟","عَلَيْهِ","فَعَرَفَهُمْ","وَهُمْ","لَهُۥ","مُنكِرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-12-62-7","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znaju je","en":"they know it"},{"bs":"pa ih znate","en":"so you (all) know them"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"znaju","en":"they know"}],"ref":"12:62","answerWord":"يَعْرِفُونَهَآ","answerSound":"audio/c86b1351f74b832f1393.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said unto his young men: Place their merchandise in their saddlebags, so that they may know it when they go back to their folk, and so will come again.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","لِفِتْيَٰنِهِ","ٱجْعَلُوا۟","بِضَٰعَتَهُمْ","فِى","رِحَالِهِمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَعْرِفُونَهَآ","إِذَا","ٱنقَلَبُوٓا۟","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِهِمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْجِعُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-23-69-2","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"znaju","en":"they know"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"biva poznat","en":"he/it is known"},{"bs":"znaju je","en":"they know it"}],"ref":"23:69","answerWord":"يَعْرِفُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/a65f175994661fe0c9a7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or know they not their messenger, and so reject him?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["أَمْ","لَمْ","يَعْرِفُوا۟","رَسُولَهُمْ","فَهُمْ","لَهُۥ","مُنكِرُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-27-93-5","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ih znate","en":"so you (all) know them"},{"bs":"prepoznaješ","en":"you recognize"},{"bs":"biva poznat","en":"he/it is known"},{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"}],"ref":"27:93","answerWord":"فَتَعْرِفُونَهَا","answerSound":"audio/945df6b31a9baf421d7e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And say: Praise be to Allah Who will show you His portents so that ye shall know them. And thy Lord is not unaware of what ye (mortals) do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["وَقُلِ","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","سَيُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","فَتَعْرِفُونَهَا","وَمَا","رَبُّكَ","بِغَٰفِلٍ","عَمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-33-59-14","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju prepoznate","en":"they are known"},{"bs":"prepoznaješ","en":"you recognize"},{"bs":"znaju ih","en":"they know them"},{"bs":"znali su","en":"they knew"}],"ref":"33:59","answerWord":"يُعْرَفْنَ","answerSound":"audio/77c9187de48c72ba3d28.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Prophet! Tell thy wives and thy daughters and the women of the believers to draw their cloaks close round them (when they go abroad). That will be better, so that they may be recognised and not annoyed. Allah is ever Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلنَّبِىُّ","قُل","لِّأَزْوَٰجِكَ","وَبَنَاتِكَ","وَنِسَآءِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","يُدْنِينَ","عَلَيْهِنَّ","مِن","جَلَٰبِيبِهِنَّ","ذَٰلِكَ","أَدْنَىٰٓ","أَن","يُعْرَفْنَ","فَلَا","يُؤْذَيْنَ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","غَفُورًا","رَّحِيمًا"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"arafa-55-41-0","words":["verb:arafa"],"options":[{"bs":"biva poznat","en":"he/it is known"},{"bs":"i prepoznao ih je","en":"and he recognized them"},{"bs":"znali su","en":"they knew"},{"bs":"znaju ih","en":"they know them"}],"ref":"55:41","answerWord":"يُعْرَفُ","answerSound":"audio/53a0f801c6a08513da0b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The guilty will be known by their marks, and will be taken by the forelocks and the feet.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"znati, prepoznati","en":"to know, to recognize"},"passage":["يُعْرَفُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","بِسِيمَٰهُمْ","فَيُؤْخَذُ","بِٱلنَّوَٰصِى","وَٱلْأَقْدَامِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَفَ"}},{"id":"awa-2-11-43-1","words":["verb:awa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"sklonit ću se","en":"I will take refuge"},{"bs":"pa se sklonite!","en":"so (you all) take refuge!"},{"bs":"sklonili smo se","en":"we took refuge"},{"bs":"sklonio se","en":"he/it took refuge"}],"ref":"11:43","answerWord":"سَـَٔاوِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/00c23b10018119d8406c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: I shall betake me to some mountain that will save me from the water. (Noah) said: This day there is none that saveth from the commandment of Allah save him on whom He hath had mercy. And the wave came in between them, so he was among the drowned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skloniti se, potražiti utočište","en":"to take refuge, to shelter"},"passage":["قَالَ","سَـَٔاوِىٓ","إِلَىٰ","جَبَلٍ","يَعْصِمُنِى","مِنَ","ٱلْمَآءِ","قَالَ","لَا","عَاصِمَ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","مِنْ","أَمْرِ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَّا","مَن","رَّحِمَ","وَحَالَ","بَيْنَهُمَا","ٱلْمَوْجُ","فَكَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُغْرَقِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَوَى"}},{"id":"awa-2-11-80-7","words":["verb:awa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"sklonio bih se","en":"I (could) take refuge"},{"bs":"sklonio se","en":"he/it took refuge"},{"bs":"sklonili smo se","en":"we took refuge"},{"bs":"pa se sklonite!","en":"so (you all) take refuge!"}],"ref":"11:80","answerWord":"ءَاوِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/132b4cb58a909207635b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Would that I had strength to resist you or had some strong support (among you)!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skloniti se, potražiti utočište","en":"to take refuge, to shelter"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَوْ","أَنَّ","لِى","بِكُمْ","قُوَّةً","أَوْ","ءَاوِىٓ","إِلَىٰ","رُكْنٍ","شَدِيدٍ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَوَى"}},{"id":"awa-2-18-10-1","words":["verb:awa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"sklonio se","en":"he/it took refuge"},{"bs":"sklonio bih se","en":"I (could) take refuge"},{"bs":"pa se sklonite!","en":"so (you all) take refuge!"},{"bs":"sklonili smo se","en":"we took refuge"}],"ref":"18:10","answerWord":"أَوَى","answerSound":"audio/55418d594c8240e1abef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When the young men fled for refuge to the Cave and said: Our Lord! Give us mercy from Thy presence, and shape for us right conduct in our plight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skloniti se, potražiti utočište","en":"to take refuge, to shelter"},"passage":["إِذْ","أَوَى","ٱلْفِتْيَةُ","إِلَى","ٱلْكَهْفِ","فَقَالُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","ءَاتِنَا","مِن","لَّدُنكَ","رَحْمَةً","وَهَيِّئْ","لَنَا","مِنْ","أَمْرِنَا","رَشَدًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَوَى"}},{"id":"awa-2-18-16-6","words":["verb:awa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"pa se sklonite!","en":"so (you all) take refuge!"},{"bs":"sklonio se","en":"he/it took refuge"},{"bs":"sklonit ću se","en":"I will take refuge"},{"bs":"sklonili smo se","en":"we took refuge"}],"ref":"18:16","answerWord":"فَأْوُۥٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/960a9657d0a46de0b12a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when ye withdraw from them and that which they worship except Allah, then seek refuge in the Cave; your Lord will spread for you of His mercy and will prepare for you a pillow in your plight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skloniti se, potražiti utočište","en":"to take refuge, to shelter"},"passage":["وَإِذِ","ٱعْتَزَلْتُمُوهُمْ","وَمَا","يَعْبُدُونَ","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهَ","فَأْوُۥٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱلْكَهْفِ","يَنشُرْ","لَكُمْ","رَبُّكُم","مِّن","رَّحْمَتِهِۦ","وَيُهَيِّئْ","لَكُم","مِّنْ","أَمْرِكُم","مِّرْفَقًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَوَى"}},{"id":"awa-2-18-63-3","words":["verb:awa-2"],"options":[{"bs":"sklonili smo se","en":"we took refuge"},{"bs":"pa se sklonite!","en":"so (you all) take refuge!"},{"bs":"sklonit ću se","en":"I will take refuge"},{"bs":"sklonio se","en":"he/it took refuge"}],"ref":"18:63","answerWord":"أَوَيْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/5e96a2cd8d2530bff77e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Didst thou see, when we took refuge on the rock, and I forgot the fish - and none but Satan caused me to forget to mention it - it took its way into the waters by a marvel.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"skloniti se, potražiti utočište","en":"to take refuge, to shelter"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَرَءَيْتَ","إِذْ","أَوَيْنَآ","إِلَى","ٱلصَّخْرَةِ","فَإِنِّى","نَسِيتُ","ٱلْحُوتَ","وَمَآ","أَنسَىٰنِيهُ","إِلَّا","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","أَنْ","أَذْكُرَهُۥ","وَٱتَّخَذَ","سَبِيلَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْبَحْرِ","عَجَبًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَوَى"}}]